    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67394" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηλίτης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ,
